import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Moduli.Boundedness
import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Moduli.Probes

/-!
# Generic moduli interfaces

Neutral interfaces shared by geometric moduli problems and categorical
stability packages: boundedness problems, and the family probes in which
charge, openness and relative Harder--Narasimhan conditions are stated.
Concrete parameter spaces, finite-type witnesses, and scheme presentations
remain with their geometric owners.
-/
